WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.300
Every client meeting is pure gold.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.180
The problem?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.380
It vanishes the second your rep walks out.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.180
With Reedly, one tap and it's handled.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.580
Your rep talks, Reedly listens.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.300
Two minutes later, the report is ready.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:17.850
Opportunities, objections, competitors,

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.060
next steps.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.100
All sorted and straight into your CRM.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:22.980
And you?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.370
You finally see the whole field.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.500
Every client gets a profile
that fills itself in.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.780
Got a question?

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.380
Max has the answer.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.140
Why that offer is slipping?

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.060
Which client is on the fence?

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.060
Where your next deal is hiding?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.900
Your numbers tell you what.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.580
Reedly tells you why.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.900
Your reps talk, you steer.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.510
Reedly.
